#5 unchoose L5 되돌리기: path에서 3 빼기 → path = [1, 2]
    path=[1,2] | graph{시작? +1? +2* +3✓({1,2,3})} edges{root-I~ I-II~ II-III=} @II | calls[backtrack(0){"i":0} > backtrack(1){"i":1} > backtrack(2)*{"i":2}] | vars{"찾은 부분집합":["[1, 2, 3]"],"개수":1}
