#12 unchoose L5 되돌리기: path에서 3 빼기 → path = [1]
    path=[1] | graph{시작? +1? +2✓ +3✓({1,2,3}) −3✓({1,2}) −2* +3✓({1,3})} edges{root-I~ I-II= II-III= II-IIO= I-IO~ IO-IOI=} @IO | calls[backtrack(0){"i":0} > backtrack(1){"i":1} > backtrack(2)*{"i":2}] | vars{"찾은 부분집합":["[1, 2, 3]","[1, 2]","[1, 3]"],"개수":3}
