    path=[] | graph{시작? +1✓ +2✓ +3✓({1,2,3}) −3✓({1,2}) −2✓ +3✓({1,3}) −3✓({1}) −1? +2✓ +3✓({2,3}) −3✓({2}) −2* +3✓({3})} edges{root-I= I-II= II-III= II-IIO= I-IO= IO-IOI= IO-IOO= root-O~ O-OI= OI-OII= OI-OIO= O-OO~ OO-OOI=} @OO | calls[backtrack(0){"i":0} > backtrack(1){"i":1} > backtrack(2)*{"i":2}] | vars{"찾은 부분집합":["[1, 2, 3]","[1, 2]","[1, 3]","[1]","[2, 3]","[2]","[3]"],"개수":7}
